00:10:46,956 --> 00:10:52,956
Allied is a action, drama, war film directed by Robert Zemeckis.

3
00:16:10,434 --> 00:16:16,434
In 1942, an intelligence officer in North Africa encounters a female French
Resistance fighter on a deadly mission behind enemy lines.

4
00:21:33,913 --> 00:21:39,913
When they reunite in London, their relationship is
tested by the pressures of war.

5
