George Kavanagh, played by Daniel Betts.

11
00:59:18,260 --> 00:59:24,260
Allied is a 2016 romantic war drama thriller film directed by
Robert Zemeckis and written by Steven Knight.

12
01:04:41,739 --> 01:04:47,739
It stars Brad Pitt as a Canadian intelligence officer and Marion Cotillard as a French Resistance fighter
who falls in love while posing as a married couple during a mission in Casablanca in 1942.

13
01:10:05,217 --> 01:10:11,217
Jared Harris, Simon McBurney and Lizzy Caplan also star.

14
01:15:28,695 --> 01:15:34,695
Knight developed the script from a story told to him when he was 21.

15
01:20:52,173 --> 01:20:58,173
Principal photography began in February 2016 in London and continued in May
2016 in the Canary Islands, used to stand in for Morocco.

16
01:26:15,652 --> 01:26:21,652
Joanna Johnston designed the film's costumes, matching them
to the characters' mindsets and situations.

17
01:31:39,130 --> 01:31:45,130
The film premiered in Los Angeles on November 9, 2016, and was released in
the United States on November 23, 2016, by Paramount Pictures.

18
01:37:02,608 --> 01:37:08,608
It received mixed reviews from critics, with praise for its costume design, cinematography, and musical
score, but saw criticism for its screenplay and the lack of chemistry between the leads.

19
01:42:26,086 --> 01:42:32,086
It grossed $40.1 million domestically and $119 million worldwide against an
approximate $85–113 million budget, becoming regarded as a box office flop.

20
01:47:49,565 --> 01:47:55,565
At the 89th Academy Awards, it was nominated for Best Costume Design.

21
01:53:13,043 --> 01:53:19,043
The film explores themes of nazi, resistance, spy, world war ii, past.

22
01:58:36,521 --> 01:58:42,521
The tone is emotional and intense.
